- op: discuss  # 44c6
  at: '2026-02-27T02:58:09Z'  # 44c6
  by: agent  # 44c6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 44c6
  clock: 11  # 44c6
  nonce: 44c6  # 44c6
  message: "Done. Ruby: added ListNameResolver for receiver-call fallback path. Rust: replaced ad-hoc 3/N penalty with ListNameResolver(ambiguity_threshold=3). Java: added method registry infrastructure (invariant already held by construction — qualified lookups). Python: exempt — SymbolResolver uses (module, symbol) tuple keys, no bare method name fallback exists. Dart: was already adopted."  # 44c6
